+    "intuition_type": "decomposition",
+    "intuition_description": (
+        "Residues modulo 997 reveal four-element blocks whose two equal-sum "
+        "pairs compose into the required spectral partition; without that "
+        "decomposition one faces balanced PARTITION."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: the construction-aware residue-bucket decoder is O(n), "
+        "uses at most 5n/2 exact arithmetic operations (240 at shipping "
+        "n=96), and is measured in selftest; construction-blind "
+        "Horowitz--Sahni PARTITION takes Theta(2^(n/2)) = 2^48 subset "
+        "entries at that preset, while performing 96 large-integer "
+        "reductions and the ensuing pair tests accurately is not a "
+        "realistic no-tool procedure."
+    ),
